rift. Spoilage is negligible because sales are oldest-first and stock never gets near 6–8 days' worth of demand.\n\n- **Product 0:** candidate 4 cuts lost sales from about 71 to about 28. That gain is worth about 690 (16 per unit: 10 revenue plus 6 penalty avoided). Against it are about 445 in extra purchases and about 165 in holding. Net: candidate 4 is ahead by about 75.\n- **Product 1:** candidate 4 cuts lost sales by about 34, worth about 610 (18 per unit). Against it are about 625 in extra purchases and about 120 in holding. Net: candidate 7 is ahead by about 130.\n\nOverall, candidate 7 comes out about 50 ahead of candidate 4.\n\n**4. The rest.**\n- Candidate 6 is close to candidate 7 in order size but pays more in order fees, so it lands about 70 behind.\n- Candidate 3 is about the same size as candidate 4 but daily, so it is a bit below 4.\n- Candidates 2 and 1 over-order and lose money on surplus stock, holding, and waste at the end.\n- Candidates 5 and 0 lose on holding."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3687, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2269, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3687}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-27T14:58:10.957Z", "request_id": "req_011CgSwDQ1AgR63D33tyQTd6"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_0119AcKuxGQc5t1JMo7ABYCH", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg